Caustra

This project is a standalone, modified path-tracing extraction based on the
architecture and rendering algorithms in NVIDIA vk_gltf_renderer. It is not
an NVIDIA product. The host backend and scene API were restructured to remove
glTF import, rasterization, editor, animation and sky dependencies. NVIDIA
DLSS Ray Reconstruction is supported as an optional rendering-core backend.

